{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542890/extras/ac8ecc3cb75ff033e5a4e87be5e1c89c.avif?t=1749515323\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542890/extras_big/ac8ecc3cb75ff033e5a4e87be5e1c89c.avif?t=1749515323 width=800 height=160 /></span>The Mad God reigns supreme over a remote cluster of asteroids known as Grumblemoor. The creatures of this strange land have but one hope for liberation: an ancient prophecy which foretells the coming of a creature from the deepest reaches of space. The chosen one, known only as the Grumbler, shines a light on a future wrought with unyielding shadow. But the universe hangs in the balance, for the prophecy states that to bring light back to the land of Grumblemoor, one must purge the darkness within. <br><br><br>Grumblemoor is a 2d action-platformer with collectathon, puzzler, and rogue-like elements. The game lets you explore a colorful haunted world, fight and befriend its bizarre inhabitants, unlock new upgrades which transform combat and movement, and unravel a story of epic proportions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Colorful Haunted World!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542890/extras/5a533bb801b879933ce0dd4a21590b1c.poster.avif?t=1749515323\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542890/extras/5a533bb801b879933ce0dd4a21590b1c.webm?t=1749515323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542890/extras/5a533bb801b879933ce0dd4a21590b1c.mp4?t=1749515323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets stashed away in each of Grumblemoor's distinct regions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight and Befriend Grumblemoor's Strange inhabitants!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542890/extras/752724a085a9e97b83745cc1a6d5ac81.poster.avif?t=1749515323\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542890/extras/752724a085a9e97b83745cc1a6d5ac81.webm?t=1749515323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the enemies are cute, some of the friends are slimy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock New Upgrades Which Transform Combat and Movement!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542890/extras/59025fac7e324fa7599f55cbdd256d8b.poster.avif?t=1749515323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542890/extras/59025fac7e324fa7599f55cbdd256d8b.webm?t=1749515323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world world in which silent space frogs have knives in their feet and wings on their backs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3542890?t=1749515323","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542890/9d21af2d6081a9b414092a8586def9fcf80daca9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749